          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mrwv1sdebrlvtwk0",
          "message": {
            "text": "O1 (maintainer decision 2026-07-23): a play during an active turn queues; **identical queued content coalesces** (`queue.includes(content)`), so repeated play clicks collapse to one pending worklist trigger while distinct custom prompts stay FIFO. Exact-string matching is deliberate — the worklist trigger text is stable within a session, and semantic dedup would risk dropping genuinely different prompts. `hotsheet_signal_done`/fallback done fire only when the queue drains (see `onTurnEnded`), so busy cannot clear between queued turns.\n",
            "markdown": "O1 (maintainer decision 2026-07-23): a play during an active turn queues; **identical queued content coalesces** (`queue.includes(content)`), so repeated play clicks collapse to one pending worklist trigger while distinct custom prompts stay FIFO. Exact-string matching is deliberate — the worklist trigger text is stable within a session, and semantic dedup would risk dropping genuinely different prompts. `hotsheet_signal_done`/fallback done fire only when the queue drains (see `onTurnEnded`), so busy cannot clear between queued turns.\n"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/codexAppServer.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 107,
                  "endLine": 124,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "export function spawnCodexAppServerRun(dataDir: string, serverPort: number, content: string, deps: CodexAppServerDeps = {}): boolean {\n  const existing = sessions.get(dataDir);\n  let session: Session;\n  if (existing === undefined || existing.finished) {\n    const created = createSession(dataDir, serverPort, deps);\n    if (created === null) return false;\n    sessions.set(dataDir, created);\n    session = created;\n  } else {\n    session = existing;\n  }\n  // O1 — queue + coalesce: an identical prompt already queued is not queued again\n  // (repeated play clicks collapse to one pending trigger); distinct prompts FIFO.\n  if (!session.queue.includes(content)) session.queue.push(content);\n  session.deps.postHeartbeat(serverPort, session.secret, 'busy'); // busy from the click\n  if (session.phase === 'idle') void startNextTurn(session);\n  return true;\n}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ]
          },
